flowchart TB
  S([Start: grid rows or<br/>uploaded CSV]) --> R[Read rows,<br/>write COMS Bulk Run]
  R --> L{{For each row}}
  L --> V{VALIDATE or<br/>APPLY mode?}
  V -- validate --> C1[Check row: action, IDs,<br/>position exists, no duplicate] --> W1[Write row VALID / INVALID]
  V -- apply --> C2[ProcessBulkRoleRow<br/>sub-orchestration] --> AR[Staffing Assign_Roles<br/>add or remove position]
  AR --> OK{Accepted?}
  OK -- yes --> AU[WriteAuditRecord<br/>ASSIGN / REMOVE POSITION] --> W2[Row DONE]
  OK -- no --> W3[Row FAILED<br/>with Workday's message]
  W1 --> L
  W2 --> L
  W3 --> L
  L -- all rows --> E[Update run status:<br/>Validated / Applied / Rejected] --> X([End: results page refreshes])
